- **Elephant (right)** is **standing near the road edge** and **partially blocking the right lane**.
- **Gorilla (left)** is **near bushes** and **not directly on the road**.
- **Gorilla (background)** is **near the building** and **not immediately threatening**.
- **Ego vehicle** is **approaching the gorilla on the road** under **low-visibility conditions**.
- **Streetlight** provides **limited illumination**, contributing to **reduced visibility**.

